{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108595","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108595/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108595/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108595/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108595","id":3227459471,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7AXx-P","number":108595,"title":"[Bug]: Android Export Encryption Issue in Godot 4.4.1","user":{"login":"Lusansui1645","id":56527687,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NTI3Njg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56527687?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lusansui1645","html_url":"https://github.com/Lusansui1645","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lusansui1645/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lusansui1645/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lusansui1645/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lusansui1645/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lusansui1645/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lusansui1645/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lusansui1645/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lusansui1645/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lusansui1645/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2909900850,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTA5OTAwODUw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:export","name":"topic:export","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-07-14T05:56:40Z","updated_at":"2025-07-14T07:10:10Z","closed_at":"2025-07-14T07:07:25Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Description\n\nWhen exporting to Android in Godot 4.4.1, resources cannot be encrypted into a PCK file unless APK extension is enabled. This limitation requires OBB files for additional resources, which complicates the export process. Users expect traditional export methods similar to Windows, where all resources are encrypted into a single PCK file that can be decrypted at runtime.\n\n### Steps to Reproduce\n\n1. Open Godot 4.4.1.\n2. Attempt to export a project to Android with APK extension disabled.\n3. Observe that resources are not encrypted into a PCK file.\n4. Note that OBB files are generated for additional resources.\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\nThe exported Android APK should include encrypted resources in a PCK file, without requiring APK extension or OBB files. The PCK file should be decrypted at runtime using a hardcoded key: `2B9E5A364378E535544AA88D1F379DA22EBD3AAD2B7ECDCDE84A8BE72CC9D317`.\n\n### Additional Context\n\nThis feature is essential for simplifying the Android export process while maintaining security and compatibility with traditional Windows export methods.\n","closed_by":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108595/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108595/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}